{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/run(on:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/schedule\/run(on:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"title":"run(on:)","externalID":"s:7Systems8ScheduleV3run2ony11WorldModule0E0Vz_tF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"run"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","text":"World"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Schedule.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Schedule.swift#L114"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Runs every system once on ","type":"text"},{"code":"world","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in order, skipping those whose conditions do not hold","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the world just before their turn.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"run","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"on","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"world","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before each system, the world’s change tick advances and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldModule\/World\/lastRun"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is set to the tick of that system’s previous run, so filters such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".changed(Position.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" show the system what changed since then: changes made by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"systems after it on the previous run and before it on this one, but not its own. A system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that has not run on this world before sees every component as added and changed. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipped system has not run: the next time it runs, it sees everything since it last did."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tick advances once more after the last system, so changes made to the world between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs are newer than every system’s previous run.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/Schedule":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule","kind":"symbol","title":"Schedule","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Schedule","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Systems in the order they run."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Schedule","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/schedule"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"title":"World","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities, the components they hold, and the world’s resources."}],"type":"topic","fragme